BT /F2 10 Tf 390 812 Td (PART ONE) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 48 780 Td (THE MASTER KEY SYSTEM - STUDY QUESTIONS & ANSWERS) Tj ET
BT /F2 18 Tf 48 735 Td (Part One) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 686 Td (1. What is the world without in its relation to the world within?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 671 Td (The world without is a reflection of the world within.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 648.5 Td (2. Upon what does all possession depend?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 633.5 Td (All possession is based on consciousness.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 611 Td (3. How is the individual related to the objective world?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 596 Td (The individual is related to the objective world by the objective mind; the brain is the organ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 582.5 Td (of this mind.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 560 Td (4. How is he related to the Universal Mind?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 545 Td (He is related to the Universal Mind by the subconscious mind; the Solar Plexus is the organ of) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 531.5 Td (this mind.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 509 Td (5. What is the Universal Mind?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 494 Td (The Universal Mind is the life principle of every atom which is in existence.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 471.5 Td (6. How can the Individual act on the Universal?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 456.5 Td (The ability of the individual to think is his ability to act upon the Universal and bring it) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 443 Td (into manifestation.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 420.5 Td (7. What is the result of this action and interaction?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 405.5 Td (The result of this action and interaction is cause and effect; every thought is a cause and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 392 Td (every condition an effect.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 369.5 Td (8. How are harmonious and desirable conditions secured?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 354.5 Td (Harmonious and desirable conditions are obtained by right thinking.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 332 Td (9. What is the cause of all discord, inharmony, lack and limitation?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 317 Td (Discord, inharmony, lack and limitation are the result of wrong thinking.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 294.5 Td (10. What is the source of all powers?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 279.5 Td (The source of all power is the world within, the Universal Fountain of Supply, the Infinite) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 266 Td (Energy of which each individual is an outlet.) Tj ET
