BT /F2 10 Tf 48 356 Td (18. What is the result of the operation of this law?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 341 Td (Our environment reflects conditions corresponding to the predominant mental attitude which we) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 327.5 Td (entertain.) Tj ET
