BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 290 Td (The Law of Attraction.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 267.5 Td (20. How is the law stated?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 252.5 Td (Thought is a creative energy, and will automatically correlate with is object and bring it) Tj ET
