BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 494 Td (Our "Own.") Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 471.5 Td (46. What is our "Own"?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 456.5 Td (What we inherently are, and is the result of our past thinking, both conscious and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 443 Td (subconscious.) Tj ET
