BT /F2 18 Tf 48 735 Td (Part Six) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 686 Td (51. What are some of the effects which can be produced by electricity?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 671 Td (Heat, light, power, music.) Tj ET
