BT /F2 10 Tf 60 596 Td (Universal?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 583 Td (The conditions and experiences with which we meet.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 560.5 Td (54. How may these conditions be changed?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 545.5 Td (By changing the mechanism by which the Universal is differentiated in form.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 523 Td (55. What is this mechanism?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 508 Td (The brain.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 485.5 Td (56. How may it be changed?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 470.5 Td (By the process we call thinking. Thoughts produce brain cells, and these cells respond to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 457 Td (corresponding thought in the Universal.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 434.5 Td (57. Of what value is the power of concentration?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 419.5 Td (It is the very highest personal accomplishment which can be acquired, and the distinguishing) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 406 Td (characteristic of every successful man or woman.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 383.5 Td (58. How may it be acquired?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 368.5 Td (By faithfully practicing the exercises in this System.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 346 Td (59. Why is this so important?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 331 Td (Because it will enable us to control our thoughts, and since thoughts are causes conditions) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 317.5 Td (must be effects; if we can control the cause we can also control the effect.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 295 Td (60. What is changing conditions and multiplying results in the objective world?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 280 Td (Men are learning the basic methods of constructive thinking.) Tj ET
