BT /F2 10 Tf 390 812 Td (PART SEVEN) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 48 780 Td (THE MASTER KEY SYSTEM - STUDY QUESTIONS & ANSWERS) Tj ET
BT /F2 18 Tf 48 735 Td (Part Seven) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 686 Td (61. What is visualization?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 671 Td (The process of making mental pictures.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 648.5 Td (62. What is the result of this method of thought?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 633.5 Td (By holding the image or picture in mind, we can gradually but surely bring the thing nearer to) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 620 Td (us. We can be what we will to be.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 597.5 Td (63. What is Idealization?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 582.5 Td (It is a process of visualizing or idealizing the plans which will eventually materialize in) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 569 Td (our objective world.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 546.5 Td (64. Why are clearness and accuracy necessary?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 531.5 Td (Because "seeing" creates "feeling" and "feeling" creates "being." First the mental, then the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 518 Td (emotional, then the illimitable possibilities of achievement.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 495.5 Td (65. How are they obtained?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 480.5 Td (Each repeated action renders the image more accurate than the former one.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 458 Td (66. How is the material for the construction of your mental image secured?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 443 Td (By millions of mental workers. Brain cells they are called.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 420.5 Td (67. How are the necessary conditions for bringing about the materialization of your) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 60 405.5 Td (ideal in the objective world secured?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 392.5 Td (By the Law of Attraction. The natural law by which all conditions and experiences are brought) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 379 Td (about.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 356.5 Td (68. What three steps are necessary in order to bring this law into operation?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 341.5 Td (Earnest Desire, Confident Expectation, Firm Demand.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 319 Td (69. Why do many fail?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 304 Td (Because they concentrate on loss, disease and disaster. The law is operating perfectly; the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 290.5 Td (things they fear are coming upon them.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 268 Td (70. What is the alternative?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 253 Td (Concentrate on the ideals which you desire to see manifested in your life.) Tj ET
