BT /F2 10 Tf 48 686 Td (71. What is the imagination?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 671 Td (A form of constructive thought. The light by which we penetrate new worlds of thought and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 657.5 Td (experience. The mighty instrument by which every inventor or discoverer opened the way from) Tj ET
