BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 467 Td (The result of ignorance.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 444.5 Td (76. What is knowledge?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 429.5 Td (The result of man's ability to think.) Tj ET
