BT /F2 18 Tf 48 735 Td (Part Twenty-Three) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 686 Td (221. What is the first law of success?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 671 Td (Service.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 648.5 Td (222. How may we be of the most service?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 633.5 Td (Have an open mind; be interested in the race rather than the goal, in the pursuit rather than) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 620 Td (possession.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 597.5 Td (223. What is the result of a selfish thought?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 582.5 Td (It contains the germs of dissolution.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 560 Td (224. How will our greatest success be achieved?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 545 Td (By a recognition of the fact that it is just as essential to give as to receive.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 522.5 Td (225. Why do financiers frequently meet with great success?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 507.5 Td (Because they do their own thinking.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 485 Td (226. Why do the great majority in every country remain the docile and apparently) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 60 470 Td (willing tools of the few?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 457 Td (Because they let the few do all their thinking for them.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 434.5 Td (227. What is the effect of concentrating upon sorrow and loss?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 419.5 Td (More sorrow and more loss.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 397 Td (228. What is the effect of concentrating upon gain?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 382 Td (More gain.) Tj ET
