BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 344.5 Td (It is the only principle which is ever used, or ever can be used; there is no other principle.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 331 Td (The fact that it may be used unconsciously does not alter the situation.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 308.5 Td (230. What is the practical application of this principle?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 293.5 Td (The fact that success is an effect, not a cause, and if we wish to secure the effect we must) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 280 Td (ascertain the cause, or idea or thought by which the effect is created.) Tj ET
