BT /F2 13 Tf 48 812 Td (UNLEASH YOUR POWER) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 390 812 Td (PART TWENTY-FOUR) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 48 780 Td (THE MASTER KEY SYSTEM - STUDY QUESTIONS & ANSWERS) Tj ET
BT /F2 18 Tf 48 735 Td (Part Twenty-Four) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 686 Td (231. Upon what principle does the theory and practice of every system of Metaphysics) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 60 671 Td (in existence depend?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 658 Td (Upon a knowledge of the Truth concerning yourself and the world in which you life.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 635.5 Td (232. What is the Truth concerning yourself?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 620.5 Td (The real I or ego is spiritual and can therefore never be less than perfect.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 598 Td (233. What is the method of destroying any form of error?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 583 Td (To absolutely convince yourself of the Truth concerning the condition which you wish to see) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 569.5 Td (manifested.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 547 Td (234. Can we do this for others?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 532 Td (The Universal Mind in which we live and move and have our being is one and indivisible; it is) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 518.5 Td (therefore just as possible to help others as to help ourselves.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 496 Td (235. What is the Universal Mind?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 481 Td (The totality of all mind in existence.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 458.5 Td (236. Where is the Universal Mind?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 443.5 Td (The Universal Mind is omnipresent, it exists everywhere. There is no place where it is not. It) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 430 Td (is therefore within us. It is The World within. It is our spirit, our life.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 407.5 Td (237. What is the nature of the Universal Mind?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 392.5 Td (It is spiritual and consequently creative. It seeks to express itself in form.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 370 Td (238. How may we act on the Universal Mind?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 355 Td (Our ability to think is our ability to act on the Universal Mind and bring it into) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 341.5 Td (manifestation for the benefit of ourselves or others.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 319 Td (239. What is meant by thinking?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 304 Td (Clear, decisive, calm, deliberate, sustained thought with a definite end in view.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 281.5 Td (240. What will be the result?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 266.5 Td (You will be able to say, It is not I that doeth the works, but the Father that dwelleth) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 253 Td (within me, He doeth the works. You will come to know that the Father is the Universal Mind) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 239.5 Td (and that He does really and truly dwell within you, in other words, you will come to know that) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 226 Td (the wonderful promises made in the Bible are fact, not fiction, and can be demonstrated by) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 212.5 Td (anyone having sufficient understanding.) Tj ET
